ue":["aura","illusion","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"zQYlPI7LcuJThTrD","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689103850708,"modifiedTime":1689103911439,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Myriad Tongues","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["finesse"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"TBH0FLjtLsxG6Bj4":{"damage":"2d12+4","damageType":"void"}},"bonus":{"value":17},"attackEffects":{"value":["warding-horror"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"WfoFZ0gLtx3NIW0f","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689103941141,"modifiedTime":1721534104810,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Invisible Claw","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","finesse"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"vWCYd9pOPF28zIQN":{"damage":"2d10+4","damageType":"slashing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":17},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"aZIiSDMIyUbaR926","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689103941835,"modifiedTime":1689104084621,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Warding Horror","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The susurration's last action was a successfully Strike with its myriad tongues that dealt damage to a creature</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Twisting, shadowy coils of negative energy and body horror branch out from the creature initially licked by the susurration's horrifying tongues. Up to two other creatures within 15 feet of the target take @Damage[2d6[void],2d6[mental]]{2d6 negative and 2d6 mental} damage, with a @Check[type:will|dc:22|basic:true] save.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["mental","void"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"euW13UUj0aqxBQZz","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689103969528,"modifiedTime":1691261012421,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Hole in the World","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The susurration releases a wave of negative energy. All creatures in the susurration's voice thief aura take @Damage[3d8[void]] damage with a basic @Check[type:fortitude|dc:22] save. A creature that fails this save is also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Sickened]{Sickened 1}, and one that critically fails is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Sickened]{Sickened 2}. As long as the susurration isn't @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Grabbed]{Grabbed} or @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Restrained]{Restrained}, it can then choose to teleport up to 20 feet away. This movement is a teleportation effect; it doesn't trigger reactions and isn't impacted by difficult terrain or obstacles. The susurration can't use Hole in the World again for [[/br 1d4 #Hole in the World Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["manipulate","void"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"X0ofKFdLTDS397sn","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689104095172,"modifiedTime":1691261012436,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736309335517,"lastModifiedBy":"pE7amWuydpTk8Jkp","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"CdwLWUGp1hRDxIFi","folder":"3x5VQ7TD4gePAtOj","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":0}